# error-key-missing-value

## Input

```
lonely
next 1

```

## CST

```
SOURCE_FILE@0..14
  ENTRY@0..7
    WORD_KEY@0..6
      WORD@0..6 "lonely"
    NEWLINE@6..7 "\n"
  ENTRY@7..14
    WORD_KEY@7..11
      WORD@7..11 "next"
    SPACE@11..12 " "
    INTEGER@12..13
      NUMERAL@12..13 "1"
    NEWLINE@13..14 "\n"
```

## Syntax Error

```
[
    SyntaxError {
        message: "missing value for the key",
        range: 6..6,
    },
]
```

## AST

```
SourceFile {
    items: [
        Entry {
            key: WordKey {
                word: WORD@0..6 "lonely",
            },
            value: none,
        },
        Entry {
            key: WordKey {
                word: WORD@7..11 "next",
            },
            value: Integer {
                sign: none,
                numeral: NUMERAL@12..13 "1",
            },
        },
    ],
}
```

